sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Browser
    participant BE as Java Backend
    participant GH as GitHub API

    User->>BE: Open /checkin.html
    User->>BE: POST /demo/api/checkin {userId, repo}
    BE->>GH: Fetch public issues
    GH-->>BE: Issues JSON
    BE->>BE: Classify → Metrics → Stress Score
    BE->>BE: Record snapshot (PostgreSQL)
    BE-->>User: Score + breakdown + hover hints

    User->>BE: Open /study.html → Load Data
    BE-->>User: Snapshots over time
    User->>User: Click participant tile
    User->>BE: /checkin.html?userId=X&repo=Y
    BE-->>User: Auto-runs stress check
